    <p><strong>Please Read Carefully:</strong> By accessing, browsing, or interacting with <strong>sthithaquantum.com</strong>, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be legally bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions and our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </div>

