    <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User", "you", or "your") and <strong>{company.legalName}</strong> ("Sthitha", "we", "us", or "our"), incorporated and existing under the laws of India, with our registered location in {company.location}.</p>
    <p>If you do not agree to these terms, you must immediately discontinue using this website and any materials derived from it.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="about-sthitha" class="legal-section">
    <h2>2. About Sthitha &amp; Scope of Services</h2>
    <p>The website provides informational, educational, and introductory technical resources regarding our three core operational pillars:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sthitha Exodia:</strong> Our initiative exploring post-quantum cryptographic discovery, quantum risk awareness, inventory analysis, and migration planning for enterprise systems.</li>
      <li><strong>Sthitha Academy:</strong> Structured quantum computing courses, educational modules, and bilingual learning resources (including Malayalam-language education) designed for beginners, developers, and researchers.</li>
      <li><strong>Research &amp; Innovation:</strong> Technical publications, explainers, algorithmic studies, and quantum machine learning explorations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Nothing on this website constitutes a formal offer, binding commercial proposal, or cryptographic service level agreement (SLA) unless expressly executed in a separate, written enterprise Master Services Agreement (MSA) signed by authorized signatories of {company.legalName}.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="advisory-disclaimer" class="legal-section">
    <h2>3. Technical &amp; Educational Disclaimer</h2>
    <div class="legal-warning">
      <p><strong>Not Legal or Cryptographic Audit Advice:</strong> Articles, blog insights, benchmark illustrations, and architectural demonstrations published on this website are provided strictly for educational and conceptual information.</p>
    </div>
    <p>In particular:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Content concerning post-quantum cryptography, NIST standards (such as FIPS 203, FIPS 204, and FIPS 205), and algorithmic complexity reflects current research developments and should not be construed as legal counsel, certified cybersecurity audit verification, or an absolute guarantee of cryptographic invulnerability.</li>
      <li>All interactive demonstrations, particle visuals, and user interface mockups are artistic and technical illustrations demonstrating conceptual capabilities; they do not represent live client telemetry or operational enterprise instances.</li>
      <li>You are solely responsible for verifying the suitability of any architectural concept or algorithm before implementing it in production environments.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="academy-courses" class="legal-section">
    <h2>4. Sthitha Academy &amp; Course Delivery</h2>
    <p>Courses published under the Sthitha Academy banner (including the <em>Quantum Computing Crash Course</em> and <em>Quantum Computing in Malayalam</em>) are hosted and distributed through authorized third-party platforms such as Udemy:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Enrolment, Payments &amp; Refunds:</strong> Student registration, fee payments, local taxation, billing processing, and refund requests are governed exclusively by the relevant platform's Terms of Service and refund policies. Sthitha does not collect or process credit card credentials through this website.</li>
      <li><strong>License to Course Materials:</strong> Enrolment in a Sthitha Academy course grants a personal, revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access the educational video streams and accompanying exercises for personal learning. Unauthorized reproduction, public broadcasting, screen recording, torrenting, or commercial redistribution of course materials is strictly prohibited.</li>
      <li><strong>Course Completion Certificates:</strong> Digital completion certificates issued by host platforms certify course completion and do not confer accredited university degrees or statutory professional certifications.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="intellectual-property" class="legal-section">
    <h2>5. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
    <p>All intellectual property rights in and to this website and its contents—including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, brand emblems, interactive code scripts, vector illustrations, course outlines, and research articles—are the exclusive property of {company.legalName} or its licensors and are protected under Indian and international copyright, trademark, and trade secret laws.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Permitted Use:</strong> You may view, download, and share excerpts of public research articles for non-commercial, personal educational purposes, provided that full attribution to {company.name} and a direct link to the original URL are maintained.</li>
