      <li>Utilize automated spiders, scrapers, data-mining bots, or extraction scripts to harvest data from our pages without permission.</li>
      <li>Submit fraudulent, deceptive, defamatory, or unlawful material through our contact or partnership forms.</li>
      <li>Impersonate any person, employee, researcher, or entity affiliated with {company.legalName}.</li>
      <li>Interfere with or overburden the infrastructure, networks, or servers hosting the site.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="confidentiality" class="legal-section">
    <h2>7. Inquiries &amp; Enterprise Information</h2>
    <p>Information submitted through our public web contact forms is treated with commercial care in accordance with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. However, transmission over the public internet does not automatically establish an attorney-client or proprietary confidentiality obligation until an official Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) is executed between both parties.</p>
    <p>Enterprise clients seeking Sthitha Exodia cryptographic discovery pilots or sensitive consultations are encouraged to request an NDA prior to disclosing proprietary infrastructure specifications or cryptographic architectures.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="disclaimer-warranties" class="legal-section">
