    <p>These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and {company.legalName} regarding the use of this website.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact-notices" class="legal-section">
    <h2>16. Legal Notices &amp; Contact Information</h2>
    <p>Official legal notices, corporate communications, or questions concerning these Terms should be addressed in writing to:</p>

    <div class="legal-officer-card">
      <div class="officer-head">
        <strong>Corporate &amp; Legal Affairs</strong>
        <span>{company.legalName}</span>
      </div>
      <dl class="officer-details">
        <div>
          <dt>Registered Jurisdiction</dt>
          <dd>{company.location}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Legal Contact Email</dt>
          <dd><a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
